是我最爱的用牙签插着吃的肉丸
are my favorite toothpick-delivered meatball.

62
00:02:38,410 --> 00:02:42,040
如果你们真迫切需要液氦  我认识个人
If you need liquid helium so bad, I know a guy

63
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:44,490
他能帮你们搞到  前提是不许问太多问题
who can get you some, if you don't ask too many questions.

64
