66
00:02:46,130 --> 00:02:48,130
问多少问题才算是太多问题
How many questions are too many questions?

67
00:02:49,570 --> 00:02:50,800
或许他不适合你们
Maybe he's not for you.

68
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:53,110
四题  答案是四题
Four questions. There answer's four.

69
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:57,170
你知道之前谁晚上去约会了吗
Hey, you know who went out on a date the other night?

70
