94
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,220
单身女子
who are using the app.

95
00:03:50,220 --> 00:03:52,650
如果我喜欢她们的长相  那就点"赞"
If I like the way they look, I hit "Thumbs up."

96
00:03:52,650 --> 00:03:54,280
如果不喜欢  就点"烂"
If I don't, "Thumbs down."

97
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:56,860
那怎么样的情况会让你给姑娘点"烂"呢
Oh, what would make you give a girl a thumbs down?

98
00:03:56,860 --> 00:03:59,470
首次发生时  我会告诉你
First time it happens I will let you know.

99
00:04:03,260 --> 00:04:06,040
我收到那个氦气男的回信了
Oh, hey. I just heard back from the liquid helium guy.

100
