他怎么说
What's he say?

101
00:04:07,530 --> 00:04:10,070
他有我们要的东西  可以今晚交易
He's got what we need and can meet us tonight.

102
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:12,270
是吗
Oh, really?

103
00:04:12,270 --> 00:04:15,010
你知道我不喜欢晚上买东西
You know I don't like buying things at night.

104
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:18,020
2009年1月7日
January 7, 2009.

105
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:19,910
我晚上11点半去买
I went to the Ralph's at 11:30pm to pick up

106
