Uh, but this is violating university code.

129
00:05:15,580 --> 00:05:17,210
稍微有点  但...
A little, but...

130
00:05:17,490 --> 00:05:19,710
爱因斯坦曾说过
if I may quote Einstein,

131
00:05:19,710 --> 00:05:22,210
"追求科学需要我们
"The pursuit of science calls us

132
