I'm not sure how I feel about this.

142
00:05:53,410 --> 00:05:55,090
放心  就让他把软件装你手机上吧
Oh, come on, just let him put the app on your phone.

143
00:05:55,090 --> 00:05:57,220
对啊  斯尔图特约到了两个妞呢
Yeah, Stuart got two dates with it.

144
00:05:57,220 --> 00:06:00,810
其中一个要没拒绝我  早发展到床上了
One of which would've ended in sex had she not said no.

145
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:03,760
好了  装好了
