146
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:04,970
让我看看
Okay, let me see.

147
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:07,520
不行  不行
Nope, nope,

148
00:06:07,930 --> 00:06:08,870
不行
nope...

149
00:06:08,870 --> 00:06:10,550
这个帅气
Oh, he's cute!

150
00:06:10,550 --> 00:06:12,020
泪滴图案的纹身
Doesn't a teardrop tattoo

151
